# Raw transcripts of the calibration and pilot runs stay out of git. Every trial of every run is summarised in
# results/trials_summary.csv (harness/summary.py), which the calibration log and the findings PDF are built from.
runs/*
!runs/20261021-final-empty10/
!runs/20261021-final-net10/
!runs/20261026-final-cp11to20/
!runs/20261026-counterfactuals-10/
!runs/20261026-counterfactuals-11to20/
# Viewer pages are regenerated with harness/viewer.py.
runs/*/view/
# The authors' replication package is public; fetch it with harness/fetch_data.py.
source/
__pycache__/
